+ * prefix as log.cpp does, hand it on. The three kernel32 functions are declared
+ * rather than pulled from <windows.h>, because this file already includes
+ * wineunixlib.h and adding windows.h beside it is a second chance for two
+ * header sets to disagree about a type. All three come from kernel32's import
+ * library, so this links.
